+##
+## File: erl-xcomp.conf.template
+## Author:
+##
+## -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+## When cross compiling Erlang/OTP using `otp_build', copy this file and set
+## the variables needed below. Then pass the path to the copy of this file as
